WEBVTT

00:01:28.008 --> 00:01:30.221
Because it's true.

00:01:30.221 --> 00:01:32.458
It is absolutely true.

00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:38.014
Between 1993 and 2010,

00:01:38.014 --> 00:01:41.347
domestic violence among adult women

00:01:41.347 --> 00:01:42.699
in the United States

00:01:42.699 --> 00:01:46.086
has gone down by 64 percent,

00:01:46.086 --> 00:01:48.763
and that is great news.

00:01:48.763 --> 00:01:51.512
(Applause)

00:01:51.512 --> 00:01:54.615
Sixty-four percent. Now, how did we get there?

00:01:54.615 --> 00:01:56.410
Our eyes were wide open.

00:01:56.410 --> 00:01:58.830
Thirty years ago, women were beaten,

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:00.965
they were stalked, they were raped,